{"id": 17, "ts": 1780453323.811025, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 1, "agent": "james_carter", "message": "I agree with Sarah that Candidate\u202fB\u2019s core strengths\u2014being very conscientious, handling stress well, and possessing solid technical judgment in weather assessment and computer use\u2014directly address the most critical pilot criteria of operational reliability, stress resilience, and technical competence. While his weak numeric memory and the tendency to make nasty remarks raise legitimate concerns about attention to detail and crew cooperation, these issues appear more manageable through targeted training and clear behavioral expectations than the more fundamental gaps we see in the other candidates (e.g., Candidate\u202fA\u2019s resistance to new ideas, Candidate\u202fC\u2019s egocentric communication style, and Candidate\u202fD\u2019s hot temper). Therefore, my provisional recommendation is to move forward with Candidate\u202fB."}
